@startuml
!include theme.iuml
title AnimeLab — sessions HTTP, protection des sites et proxies
' @source animelab/services/source_http.py:SourceHTTPService
' @source animelab/services/source_http.py:DomainSession
' @source animelab/services/source_http.py:SourceClient
' @source animelab/services/source_http.py:AsyncSourceClient
' @source animelab/services/source_http.py:SourceStreamResponse
' @source animelab/services/source_http.py:VerificationRequired
' @source animelab/services/source_http.py:RateLimited
' @source animelab/services/source_http.py:SourceNetworkError
' @source animelab/services/proxy_pool.py:ProxyPool
' @source animelab/services/proxy_service.py:ProxyService
' @source animelab/services/browser_verification.py:BrowserVerificationService
class SourceHTTPService {
  _domains: dict
  _cache: dict
  _inflight: dict
  executor: ThreadPoolExecutor
  +state(url): DomainSession
  +lease(state)
  +request(method, url, ...)
  +async_client(...)
  +classify(response, ...)
  +rotate_proxy(domain, automatic)
  +import_cookies(url, cookies)
  +diagnostics()
}
class DomainSession <<dataclass>> {
  domain: str
  proxy: Optional[str]
  cookies: MozillaCookieJar
  clients: list
  leased: int
  generation: int
  blocked_url: Optional[str]
  pending_reset: bool
  cooldown: float
}
class SourceClient {
  +request(...)
  +get(...)
  +post(...)
}
class AsyncSourceClient {
  +request(...)
  +send(...)
  +stream(...)
  +aclose()
}
class SourceStreamResponse {
  +raise_for_status()
  +aiter_bytes(...)
  +aclose()
}
class ProxyService {
  +save_proxy_settings(data)
  +get_active_proxy()
  +get_random_proxy()
  +test_proxy_connection(...)
}
class ProxyPool {
  +snapshot()
  +refresh()
  +import_json(data)
  +check(...)
  +choose(domain, current, ...)
  +watch()
}
class BrowserVerificationService {
  transport: SourceHTTPService
  jobs: dict
  webview_opener: callback
  +installed_browsers()
  +start(domain, browser, mode)
  +complete(job_id)
  +cancel(job_id)
  +expire()
}
class VerificationRequired <<exception>> {
  url: str
  domain: str
  +to_dict(): dict
}
class RateLimited <<exception>> {
  retry_after: float
}
class SourceNetworkError <<exception>> {
  kind: str
}
SourceHTTPService "1" *-- "0..*" DomainSession : une session logique / domaine
SourceHTTPService ..> SourceClient : fabrique façade synchrone
SourceClient <|-- AsyncSourceClient
SourceClient --> SourceHTTPService : délègue les opérations
AsyncSourceClient ..> SourceStreamResponse : streaming
SourceHTTPService ..> VerificationRequired : challenge détecté
SourceHTTPService ..> RateLimited : délai serveur
SourceHTTPService ..> SourceNetworkError : DNS / TLS / timeout
SourceHTTPService ..> ProxyService : configuration manuelle
SourceHTTPService ..> ProxyPool : candidat public testé
BrowserVerificationService --> SourceHTTPService : import cookies + contrôle réel
note bottom of DomainSession
Cookies et connexions partagés au niveau du domaine,
pas au niveau d'un compte utilisateur.
Un handle curl est loué exclusivement par requête.
Une rotation est refusée si leased > 0.
end note
note bottom of BrowserVerificationService
Navigateur installé via CDP ou fenêtre WebView dédiée.
Même route réseau exigée. Un simple onglet externe
ne transfère pas automatiquement ses cookies.
end note
@enduml
